Flametal is an independent game engine compatible with user-supplied Dungeon Keeper 2 data. It is
not affiliated with or endorsed by Electronic Arts. Its roots are in DiaLight's Flame
(https://github.com/DiaLight/Flame); see LICENSE for what that inherited layer is and is not.

Third-party code in libs/ keeps its own license beside it: Toml11 (MIT), lodepng (zlib), dr_mp3
(public domain / MIT-0), and Dungeon-Generator by Adrian Kulawik (MIT,
https://github.com/Adrian104/Dungeon-Generator, libs/dgen-8dfa5d2), whose BSP layouts make the
generated maps (tools/dk2map/layout.py).
